#chip 18F4550, 20

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 1 s = 5,000,000 cycles at 20 MHz, inside a 30 s loop
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 150,000,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit

Repeat for 30 s
    Wait 1 s
End Repeat
Do
Loop
